group integrated with native form submission."},"1228":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-38","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#customization","content":"`RadioGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Radio` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Radio` takes label text next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."},"1229":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-39","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-40","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-41","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-42","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a radio field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive radio state:"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-43","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-44","page_id":"/docs/components/radi