t)."],[793,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[792,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[800,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[801,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[799,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1732,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1187,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[781,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1895,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[785,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1456,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1679,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1730,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1234,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1793,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1360,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[923,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a sub