mless theme integration"],[1678,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[527,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1390,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1012,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1392,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[876,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[851,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[874,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1016,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1394,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1681,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1731,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1680,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[2108,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1893,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1892,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1954,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[839,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1890,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[841,"**DOM Output:**"],[1799,"**End**"],[786,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1726,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[857,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[845,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[830,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[779,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1397,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[833,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1913,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1925,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1797,"**Home**"],[1928,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1917,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2107,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2098,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[808,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[848,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1891,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[332,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[331,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1920,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[875,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1816,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1953,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[844,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1915,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[861,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1919,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1682,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[855,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1186,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[777,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[842,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[859,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[852,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1231,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1230,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[877,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1398,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[2135,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[843,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[838,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1889,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1926,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1818,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1894,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1924,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1921,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1357,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1358,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1447,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[337,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1955,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1887,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1393,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[873,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[529,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1684,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[1014,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1396,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1795,"**Space / Enter**"],[1236,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[336,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[921,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1361,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[837,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[847,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1455,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[1013,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1929,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1918,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[787,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[831,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1791,"**Tab**"],[335,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1233,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1359,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1729,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1727,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1728,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1188,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1787,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1786,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1933,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1922,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[846,"**Trade-offs:**"],[788,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[528,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value